/* ===== The link system ==========================================
   Every declaration reads from the --ivue-link-* tokens; tune colors
   there (per theme), never here. Two behaviors share one paint:
   - ALWAYS-ON surfaces wear the gradient at rest and melt to the
     monotonic hover family (prose, chip links, CTAs, go-arrows);
   - REVEAL surfaces render as plain text at rest and morph to the
     gradient on hover/active (sidebar, nav, outline, pagers). */

/* the shared paint: gradient-clipped text, 0.3s stop morph */
.vp-doc :is(p, li, td) > a:not([class]):not(:has(code)),
.vp-doc :is(p, li, td) > strong > a:not([class]):not(:has(code)),
.vp-doc :is(p, li, td) a:not([class]) > code,
